<BaseLayout
  title="Gated DeltaNet-2: Untying Erase and Write in Linear Attention | AI/ML Deep Dives"
  description="Gated DeltaNet-2 (NVIDIA, 2026) decouples the delta rule's single scalar gate into independent channel-wise erase and write vectors, improving long-context multi-key retrieval while preserving efficient chunkwise training."
  crumb="Gated DeltaNet-2"
