<p>Gated DeltaNet-2 ships as open-source code at <code>github.com/NVlabs/GatedDeltaNet-2</code> with Triton kernels for both recurrent and hybrid configurations. The paper also describes a hybrid design that pairs the GDN-2 recurrent mixer with Sliding-Window Attention (SWA) for even stronger performance at bounded memory cost.</p>
